\n        \"basis\": \"direct_contradiction\",\n        \"reason\": \"The stem says the bond loan must be repaid; that repayment obligation is a claim, contrary to E1.1's revenue-receipt definition.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"option\": \"C\",\n        \"decisively_wrong\": true,\n        \"basis\": \"direct_contradiction\",\n        \"reason\": \"The stem says the foreign loan is repayable with interest, creating a claim inconsistent with E1.1's definition.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"option\": \"D\",\n        \"decisively_wrong\": true,\n        \"basis\": \"direct_contradiction\",\n        \"reason\": \"The stem makes these securities redeemable, contrary to E1.1's description of revenue receipts as non-redeemable.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
